    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. The pan wall is a genuine thin shell with a visible interior, confirmed in the top view, and the base is properly closed in the bottom view. Hammered brass with heat tarnish varies believably between interior and exterior. Riveted handle join is modelled. 4.3k tris with even radial topology.",
